    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8985166f0bf14c0eaf8daaa69a3a484f",
      "statement": "Skills can supply private or fast-changing knowledge or control agent behavior at decision points, but on-demand invocation makes them unreliable as always-on constraints; project-scoped AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md files are recommended for always-on requirements.",
